# libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
