msgid "[`roles/web-app-flowise/vars/main.yml`](../../roles/web-app-flowise/vars/main.yml) currently computes discovery data but no task registers it. [`roles/web-app-flowise/templates/env.j2`](../../roles/web-app-flowise/templates/env.j2) disables `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK` globally when MCP servers are present, and [`roles/web-app-flowise/files/playwright/test-mcp.js`](../../roles/web-app-flowise/files/playwright/test-mcp.js) proves only that an anonymous chatflow call is rejected."
